This directory is a verbatim copy of the driver tree, with two changes:

  * reference/, .github/ and workflow_files/ were dropped (they only contain
    the historical Armbian patch stack and CI files).
  * unisocwcn/fw/ was dropped.  Its *.bin.hex blobs are only compiled in for
    CONFIG_WCN_DOWNLOAD_FIRMWARE_FROM_HEX (Amlogic) and CONFIG_WCN_USB, neither
    of which is used by this Rockchip port.  The runtime firmware
    (/lib/firmware/uwe5622/wcnmodem.bin) comes from the ophub firmware package.

To update:

    git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/armbian/uwe5622
    rsync -a --exclude reference --exclude .github --exclude workflow_files \
             --exclude unisocwcn/fw \
             uwe5622/{Makefile,Kconfig,unisocwcn,unisocwifi,tty-sdio} \
             make-openwrt/uwe5622/driver/
